{"_id":"69611eb3245637b68e2a9439","title":"Copy AVATAR Copy Emotes FE Copy Animation Pack FE","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/153c73b91ca40a7c3800e2b8fac8a5356599cc5f0f928662424f09916ffe6c59.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1767972531468.jpg"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/153c73b91ca40a7c3800e2b8fac8a5356599cc5f0f928662424f09916ffe6c59.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1767972531468.jpg"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Avatar-Copier-Copy-Player-Avatar-83503","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":40764,"executes":67512,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f75fe3950540e6a46546829e3457a71d4afd4315f7d1174cc53f415674a25bfd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1767972531468.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1767972531468.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f75fe3950540e6a46546829e3457a71d4afd4315f7d1174cc53f415674a25bfd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1767972531468.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1767972531468.jpg"},"likeCount":10,"dislikeCount":4,"createdAt":"2026-01-09T15:28:51.486Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-09T15:28:51.486Z","lastBump":"2026-01-09T15:28:51.486Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kixdev/avatar-copier-roblox/main/main.lua\", true))()","features":"AVATAR CREATOR COPIER (Local Overlay Avatar Copy)\n\nA client-side (local-only) Roblox developer tool that lets you visually copy another player’s avatar by spawning a local overlay avatar on top of your character. Your real Roblox avatar and server data are never modified, and other players cannot see the overlay. Designed specifically for development.\n\nMain Function\n* Visually copy any player’s avatar using Username or UserId\n* Spawn a local overlay avatar that follows your character smoothly\n* No server changes, no avatar replacement, no identity changes\n* Safe for testing because it is 100% local-only\n\nHow to Use\n* Enter a target Username or UserId in the UI\n* Click Spawn / Update Overlay to create the avatar overlay\n* The overlay will attach to your character and follow automatically\n* Enable Hide My Character to locally hide your real avatar\n* Click Remove Overlay to delete the overlay\n\nControls & UI\n* Built-in clean, draggable UI\n* Mobile and desktop friendly (mouse & touch supported)\n* Target preview with name, UserId, and thumbnail\n\nCore Technical Features\n* Smooth follow using WeldConstraint on HumanoidRootPart (no jitter)\n* Real-time pose and animation mirroring via Motor6D.Transform\n* Mirrors idle, walk, run, jump, tool animations, and emotes (game-dependent)\n* Overlay parts are non-interactive (no collision, no physics, no triggers)\n\nHotkeys\n* Hide Entire UI Press ( , ) comma\n* Safe to integrate with other local hotkey systems\n\nPrimary Use Cases\n* Cosmetic and outfit QA testing\n* Rig and body type compatibility checks\n* Avatar preview inside the game environment\n\nNotes\n* Visual-only: hitbox, username, and server-side avatar remain unchanged\n* Results may vary in games with custom rigs or animation controllers","tags":["Roblox","Avatar","Copy Avatar","Clone Avatar"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"691780d5b7d0b729179785db","username":"DEVKIX","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5fa1175dc9c381a09363f2698bf84693441eb28a74bf1f3058717490af567c2d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/691780d5b7d0b729179785db-1767043273973.png"},"status":"offline","id":"691780d5b7d0b729179785db","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5fa1175dc9c381a09363f2698bf84693441eb28a74bf1f3058717490af567c2d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo